    {
      "text": "I will bring forth unto them … much of my gospel, 1 Ne. 13:34. fulness of the gospel … come unto the Gentiles, 1 Ne. 15:13. bringing to pass much restoration, 2 Ne. 3:24. Jews … shall be restored to the true church, 2 Ne. 9:2. shall be restored … true knowledge of their Redeemer, 2 Ne. 10:2 (Morm. 9:36). restore his people from their lost and fallen state, 2 Ne. 25:17. God shall bring these things forth, 2 Ne. 26:14. book shall be of great worth unto … the house of Israel, 2 Ne. 28:2. restored unto the knowledge of their fathers, 2 Ne. 30:5. record … upon the plates … for a wise purpose, Alma 37:2. restoration of our brethren, the Lamanites, Hel. 15:11. covenant which I have made with my people is not all fulfilled, 3 Ne. 15:8. in the latter day shall the truth come, 3 Ne. 16:7.",
