      "text": "Upon you … I confer the Priesthood of Aaron, D&C 13 (JS—H 1:69). keys … are committed unto man, D&C 65:2. gather together the tribes of Israel and restore all things, D&C 77:9. church, established in the last days for the restoration, D&C 84:2. priesthood … remain … until the restoration of all things, D&C 86:10. keys of this dispensation are committed, D&C 110:16. priesthood given … dispensation of the fulness of times, D&C 112:30. restore again that which was lost … the priesthood, D&C 124:28. I am about to restore many things, D&C 127:8. his eye fixed on the restoration of the priesthood, D&C 128:17. divers angels … all declaring their dispensation, D&C 128:21. gave unto thee … an appointment, and restore all things, D&C 132:40. wherein I restore all things, D&C 132:45. sent forth mine angel … having the everlasting gospel, D&C 133:36. Lord sent forth the fulness of his gospel, D&C 133:57 (135:3).",
